      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This armored creature looks like a red skeleton. Small red pinpoints of light burn in its hollowed eye sockets as it draws its weapon.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 20, touch 12, flat-footed 18 (+3 armor, +2 dex, +5 natural)</p><p>hp 22 [36] (4d8+4)</p><p>Fort +2, Ref +3, Will +4</p><p>Defensive Abilities Channel Resistance +2</p><p>DR 5/bludgeoning or good</p><p>Immune Undead traits</p><p>Weakness Fire and Holy</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee Greatsword +6 (2d6+4/19-20), or 2 Claws +6 (1d4+3)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Hell Slash, Marrow Drain</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 17, Dex 15, Con -, Int 11, Wis 10, Cha 12</p><p>Base Atk +3; CMB +6; CMD 18</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Power Attack</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +7, Climb +5, Escape Artist +7, Perception +7, Stealth +9</p><p>Languages Abyssal</p><p>Gear Studded leather armor, greatsword</p>"
      }
